t":"2026-04-13T16:58:39Z","closed_at":"2026-04-13T16:47:48Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nmaster [9495deaf7]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.dev (9495deaf7) - Linux Mint 22.3 (Zena) on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated AMD Radeon 780M Graphics (RADV PHOENIX) - AMD Ryzen 7 8745H w/ Radeon 780M Graphics (16 threads) - 25.22 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nDiscovered while testing #118385.\n\nWhen a `LineEdit` or `TextEdit` gains focus, the editor crashes when the window loses focus after the IME stops.\n\n```\n================================================================\nhandle_crash: Program crashed with signal 11\nEngine version: Godot Engine v4.7.dev.custom_build (9495deaf7532313ff7154d8a06aa6fc100807532)\nDumping the backtrace. Please include this when reporting the bug on: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues\nLoad address: 5941257a2000\n\n[1] 7b7f22845330 - /lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libc.so.6(+0x45330) [0x7b7f22845330] (??:0)\n[2] 7b7ef56d9cb4 - /lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libX11.so.6(XUnsetICFocus+0x4) [0x7b7ef56d9cb4] (??:0)\n[3] 59412d03329d - DisplayServerX11::process_events() (/opt/godot/godot/platform/linuxbsd/x11/display_server_x11.cpp:5265)\n[4] 59412d00410c - OS_LinuxBSD::run() (/opt/godot/godot/platform/linuxbsd/os_linuxbsd.cpp:1000)\n[5] 59412d01ac24 - godot-llvm-dev(main+0x224) [0x59412d01ac24] (/opt/godot/godot/platform/linuxbsd/godot_linuxbsd.cpp:123)\n[6] 7b7f2282a1ca - /lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libc.so.6(+0x2a1ca) [0x7b7f2282a1ca] (??:0)\n[7] 7b7f2282a28b - /lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libc.so.6(__libc_start_main+0x8b) [0x7b7f2282a28b] (??:0)\n[8] 59412cffa8e5 - godot-llvm-dev(_start+0x25) [0x59412cffa8e5] (??:0)\n-- END OF C++ BACKTRACE --\n================================================================\n```\n\nThis crash is easily reproducible in the Project Manager.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bb1a26ff-d176-432f-93fb-5b2967e4f4af\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Force the Project Manager to launch with `--display-driver x11` while an IME is active;\n2. Hover the mouse over the \"Create\" button to trigger its tooltip;\n3. Force IME to exit;\n4. Hover the mouse over the \"Create\" button again to trigger its tooltip, resulting in the warning message 'XCreateIC couldn't create wd.xic.';\n5. Click the \"Create\" button to open the dialog, causing a crash.\n\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118399/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118399/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed",